      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aragon%2C_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Today Aragon remains a tight‑knit, aging ranching community with a median age of 56.7 years and 100% homeownership.",
